<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post1562826712217186044..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: The Old &quot;False-Flag Trick&quot;?</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>14</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5127737902110601290</id><published>2010-01-01T14:36:42.425-07:00</published><updated>2010-01-01T14:36:42.425-07:00</updated><title type='text'>From what I&amp;#39;ve read over at a news site in Mic...</title><content type='html'>From what I&amp;#39;ve read over at a news site in Michigan it would seem the FBI and the TSA spokes-drones are doing the Macarena with their multiple tall tales.  Who would you believe?  The Feds?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.mlive.com/news/detroit/index.ssf/2009/12/flight_253_passenger_kurt_hask.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default/5127737902110601290'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default/5127737902110601290'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html?showComment=1262381802425#c5127737902110601290' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1562826712217186044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1562826712217186044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 1, 2010 at 2:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7064857601943688085</id><published>2010-01-01T12:16:37.016-07:00</published><updated>2010-01-01T12:16:37.016-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Lemuel,&#xa;&#xa;that acre of paradise in one&amp;#39;s backya...</title><content type='html'>Lemuel,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;that acre of paradise in one&amp;#39;s backyard...now that was funny!  but i don&amp;#39;t have a backyard in this apartment, so i&amp;#39;ll create an few square feet of paradise on my balcony &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;what follows is not a criticism, but some advice to you and anyone else who finds himself in this boat...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;and i know there are some folks in this world getting over, especially those in power, but we still need to pray for them, God commanded it.  or as my sister put it to me:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;don&amp;#39;t get to heaven and the Lord shows two screens.  on one screen he shows you bad mouthing the (political) guy for hours and how he is all messed up, and then on the other screen he shows you praying for him.  and the screen is blank.&amp;quot;  God, at times, needs an intercessor.  it&amp;#39;s his passport into certain situations down here.  and when we pray for those who abuse us, not only does it help us, but it also allows Him to intervene on the sinner&amp;#39;s behalf, so that when the sinner stands (or kneels) before Him, the sinner will look on in shame as the Lord shows him all those who prayed for him, and how many times the Lord intervened on their behalf to save his soul, but his neck was so stiff, and his heart so hardened, that the Lord&amp;#39;s efforts were in vain.  and alas, he will cry for mercy, but won&amp;#39;t get it.  he will plead for his soul, but his cries will not be heard.  and then it will finally sink in -- he&amp;#39;s about to experience the most excruciating and unending pain..forever.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;as for me and my house?  i need to pray more for these folks because i admittedly fall in this boat.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rick</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default/7064857601943688085'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default/7064857601943688085'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html?showComment=1262373397016#c7064857601943688085' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1562826712217186044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1562826712217186044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-8212974"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 1, 2010 at 12:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2796813751092825058</id><published>2010-01-01T10:30:52.998-07:00</published><updated>2010-01-01T10:30:52.998-07:00</updated><title type='text'>** Example 1: &#xa;&#xa;Barrick Gold is today the largest ...</title><content type='html'>** Example 1: &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Barrick Gold is today the largest gold mining company in the world. All through the Reagan and GHW Bush Administrations, this insignificant (at the time) Canadian (NOT American) gold mining company was trying to obtain the lease on a gold claim prospect in Nevada, USA, without success. When he lost his bid for re-election in 1992, GHW Bush fast-tracked the lease through the Interior Department, and Barrick got its gold mine. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Today&amp;#39;s value of the gold under that mountain in Nevada is $30 billion. With a &amp;quot;B.&amp;quot; How much did the American people, via the Interior Department, get paid for it? In total, and in perpetuity? $10,000. No, not a typo: Ten thousand dollars. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The price of mining leases on public land, $2.50 an acre, has not been increased by ANY Congress since 1853. One wonders why.....&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Bruce Babitt, Bill Clinton&amp;#39;s Interior Secretary, called the Barrick Lease &amp;quot;The biggest gold heist since Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid.&amp;quot; Nothing could be done. It was signed, notarized, legally filed and binding on the US Government. Ten thousand dollars!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Six months after leaving office in 1993, GHW Bush was retained as a &amp;quot;Special Consultant&amp;quot; by Barrick Gold. How much did they pay him for his vast gold mining expertise? Nobody knows. As a private citizen, his tax returns and business affairs are sealed.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;....And Satan took Him up unto a high mountain, and shewed Him all the kingdoms of the world, and all the wealth and glory thereof, and said unto Him, &amp;quot;All this will I give Thee, if Thou wilt bow down and worship Me.&amp;quot; And Jesus said, &amp;quot;Get thee behind me Satan, for it is written, Man shall not live by bread alone.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;*** Example 2:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A dirt-poor Scottish farmer in the 19th century heard anguished cries for help one day, as he was working his fields. He ran to help, and found a young lad trapped and sinking to his inevitable death in a bog. He rescued the boy, washed him off, and sent him on his way.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The next day, a fine carriage pulled up at the farmer&amp;#39;s cottage, and a nobleman got out. It was the father of the boy the farmer had rescued, and the nobleman offered payment. The farmer adamantly refused, saying that saving the boy&amp;#39;s life was only an act of Christian duty.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The farmer&amp;#39;s son was standing in the doorway of the cottage, watching the exchange. The nobleman asked, &amp;quot;Is that your son?&amp;quot; The farmer said, yes, he was. The nobleman said, &amp;quot;This is what I will do. I will give your son an education equal to that of my own son, and if he is anything like his father, he will grow up to make us both proud.&amp;quot; The farmer agreed.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The farmer&amp;#39;s name was Fleming. His son graduated from the best universities in England, became a doctor and Fellow of the Royal Society, and was knighted by the King for his discovery of penicillin. His name was Sir Alexander Fleming. His discovery of antibiotics has saved countless millions of lives.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The nobleman&amp;#39;s name was Sir Randolph Spencer-Churchill, younger brother of the Duke of Marlborough. His son&amp;#39;s name was Winston - Sir Winston Churchill, who became Prime Minister in Britain&amp;#39;s most dire hour of need in World War II. Without his stubborn, pig-headed obstinacy, Britain might well have come to terms with Nazi Germany, which today might be the ruler of Europe.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;One day during the War, the Prime Minister lay desperately sick. His life was only saved by penicillin, discovered by Sir Alexander Fleming, the boy whose education Winston Churchill&amp;#39;s father had paid for.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What goes around, comes around. Be of good cheer, for God will not be mocked. Neither does He forget His true servants in their hour of need.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Hope you enjoyed those two absolutely true stories.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default/2796813751092825058'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default/2796813751092825058'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html?showComment=1262367052998#c2796813751092825058' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1562826712217186044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1562826712217186044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-97890152"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 1, 2010 at 10:30 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5384384225992364461</id><published>2010-01-01T09:33:32.818-07:00</published><updated>2010-01-01T09:33:32.818-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous @ 8:56 pm,&#xa;&#xa;Lemuel does not have a blog,...</title><content type='html'>Anonymous @ 8:56 pm,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel does not have a blog, and has been keeping a low profile since scaring himself with what he posted re. 9-11 and fearing for his continued physical comfort.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I did post a few comments right at the end of Mr. Grigg&amp;#39;s last essay on the Christmas Truce of 1914.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Bill @ 8:21 am,&lt;br /&gt;I think you have hit the nail on the head.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;All,&lt;br /&gt;Most of the spectacular crimes in America (as opposed to the liquor-store holdup variety) are originated or abbetted by the State and/or its agencies in order to justify their control and bloodsucking of We The Peasants. Or, in some cases, to make staggeringly immense profits for their corporate friends, by whom they are rewarded with cushy jobs after leaving politics.**&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Operation Northwoods, the Kennedy assassination, (only partly due to JFK&amp;#39;s squashing of Operation Northwoods,) the RFK and MLK assassinations, 9-11-2001, the Vietnam War, the present wars in Afghanistan and Iraq, and the entire Cold War (which lasted 45 years and ALMOST annihilated the world,) not to mention the TARP plundering of the American taxpayer, the Bernie Madoff mega-heist, (which was NOT a Ponzi, but a plain old theft - the $65 billion now sits in Israeli banks, less commissions earned by the Clinton and Bush families) and the Jewish Oligarchs&amp;#39; attempted plundering of Russia (which lost me personally many thousands of dollars&amp;#39; investment in YUKOS,) -- all of it was just power and money grabs on a scale which has never before been seen in the history of the world, and probably in the whole Universe of sentient beings. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I said this before - NOTHING coming from the media and government is what it seems. EVERYTHING is a lie. Keep telling yourself that and you will live a wiser, if less contented, life.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;America, America. From sea to shining sea. Truly a marvel - one of the most successful accomplishments of Satan in his long history of mischief-making. Wherever men try to build something good, Satan hustles about tramping up and down, seeking whom he might devour. So the Good Book tells us.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I would not be surprised even for a second if we learned (which we never will) that the Nigerian was either deliberately allowed to pursue his plans unhindered or was even officially helped to get on board that plane. They have been trying for a long time now to install scanners in airports which will reveal the size of your tits or your penis under your clothes, and meeting stiff resistance. (Ha, ha. Joke intended.) If they could coldly kill 3,000 Americans on 9-11, and a million Iraqis since, plus presidents at home and abroad, humanitarians, UN Secretaries-General, Popes, and 100 million people in WW1 and WW2, then of what consequence are a couple of hundred airline passengers?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Not for nothing does the Bible call Satan &amp;quot;The Prince Of This World.&amp;quot; And not for nothing did Jesus say, &amp;quot;My Kingdom is not of this world.&amp;quot; This world is a sick, sick place.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This is not going to change. All we can do is try to bring a little spark of paradise into our own small corner of the world. Mr. Grigg has done that by raising a fine family and loving his wife with his whole heart despite her chronic illness. The smallest acts of goodness can have immense consequences.*** (As too can the smallest acts of evil.)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Happy New Year! May you discover an acre of Paradise in your backyard this year.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel Gulliver&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(PS: ** and *** -- Notes will follow in another posting.)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default/5384384225992364461'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default/5384384225992364461'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html?showComment=1262363612818#c5384384225992364461' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1562826712217186044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1562826712217186044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-97890152"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 1, 2010 at 9:33 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-194362788431608748</id><published>2010-01-01T02:42:35.864-07:00</published><updated>2010-01-01T02:42:35.864-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;&amp;quot;Ahem -- yeah, well, we&amp;#39;ll take it ...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;&amp;quot;Ahem -- yeah, well, we&amp;#39;ll take it from here&amp;quot;: Government security personnel take suspected terrorist Umar Farouk Abdelmutallab into custody in Detroit after passengers did all the hard stuff -- subduing him when his &amp;quot;lap bomb&amp;quot; failed to detonate and extinguishing the incendiary device. &amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;When I read that caption, it reminded me of the ending scene of &amp;quot;Lord of War.&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default/194362788431608748'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default/194362788431608748'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html?showComment=1262338955864#c194362788431608748' title=''/><author><name>Odoacer</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1562826712217186044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1562826712217186044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1088753938"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 1, 2010 at 2:42 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4123002122745076108</id><published>2009-12-31T13:08:37.997-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-31T13:08:37.997-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Could this have been nothing more than an inside j...</title><content type='html'>Could this have been nothing more than an inside job, done for the expressed purpose of expanding and strengthening the great and wonderful Amerikan Polize State?  NAAAAH!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/defaul