s...</title><content type='html'>Exactly how is a person supposed to be able to distinguish between a well dressed Indian and a well dressed Pakistani?  The escort could have as easily been ISI or an employee of Blackwater/Xe.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default/8406873222048091146'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1562826712217186044/comments/default/8406873222048091146'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html?showComment=1262216506063#c8406873222048091146' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/old-false-flag-trick.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1562826712217186044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1562826712217186044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-794117247"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 30, 2009 at 4:41 PM"/></entry></feed>